I take my umbrella and step outside.
I walk carefully to the clinic.
The clinic is near my house.
I go inside the clinic.
It is very busy there today.
There are a lot of people in the waiting room.
I go to the reception.
A nurse is there.
She asks my name.
"My name is Maya, I have an appointment," I say.
The nurse checks my temperature.
"You have a fever, are you not feeling well?" she asks.
"No, I am not," I reply.
"My head hurts a lot," I tell her.
"Do you have throat pain?" she asks.
"Yes, I have throat pain too," I say.
"The doctor is busy right now," she says.
"You must sit there, you must wait for a little while."
I sit on a chair and wait.
